<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cabinet agrees plan for market watchdog-CTK.</title>
<headline>Czech cabinet agrees plan for market watchdog-CTK.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech government agreed on Wednesday to a finance ministry draft which would set up an independent regulator for securities markets akin to the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC), the Czech news agency CTK reported.</p>
<p>It quoted a finance ministry press aide as saying that the draft would be submitted to the parliament on Thursday.</p>
</text>
